{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/LibraryLogo.png?t=1747886120\" />Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking up a staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautifully weird stair environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No jump button. Of course there's no jump button. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716360?t=1747886120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/a3480fa1be3e9633d77ad41088bc83c3d349c244/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747886120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/50da63ade89cc2c25d9f0658b3512f3baeb28a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747886120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/50da63ade89cc2c25d9f0658b3512f3baeb28a00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747886120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":